t Specified\">Select box type...</option>\n              <option value=\"Rigid Gift Box\">Rigid Gift Box</option>\n              <option value=\"Cake / Bakery Box\">Cake / Bakery Box</option>\n              <option value=\"Luxury Paper Bag\">Luxury Paper Bag</option>\n              <option value=\"Mailer Box\">Mailer Box</option>\n              <option value=\"Kraft Bag\">Kraft Paper Bag</option>\n            </select>\n          </div>\n          \n          <div class=\"luxo-group full\">\n            <label>Project Details / Size / Style</label>\n            <textarea name=\"details\" placeholder=\"Describe your requirements (e.g. Size, Color, Branding)...\" rows=\"3\" style=\"width: 100%; background: var(--input-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 15px; color: #FFF; font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px;\"></textarea>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"luxo-group full\">\n            <label>Upload Logo / Reference (Optional)</label>\n            <div class=\"luxo-file-upload\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('file-upload-page').click()\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M16.5,6V17.5A4,4 0 0,1 12.5,21.5A4,4 0 0,1 8.5,17.5V5A2.5,2.5 0 0,1 11,2.5A2.5,2.5 0 0,1 13.5,5V15.5A1,1 0 0,1 12.5,16.5A1,1 0 0,1 11.5,15.5V6H10V15.5A2.5,2.5 0 0,0 12.5,18A2.5,2.5 0 0,0 15,15.5V5A4,4 0 0,0 11,1A4,4 0 0,0 7,5V17.5A5.5,5.5 0 0,0 12.5,23A5.5,5.5 0 0,0 18,17.5V6H16.5Z\"></path></svg>\n              <p>Click to upload PNG, AI, PDF · Max 10MB</p>\n              <span id=\"file-name-page\">No file selected</span>\n              <input type=\"file\" id=\"file-upload-page\" name=\"attachment\" class=\"hidden-file-input\" onchange=\"updateFileNamePage(this)\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-luxo-submit\">Get My Free Factory Quote</button>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- PRICING TRANSPARENCY -->\n  <section id=\"pricing\" style=\"padding: 100px 10%; background: #0D0D0D; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n    <span class=\"section-label\">Pricing Guide</span>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Transparent <em>Pricing Structure.</em></h2>\n    <p style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto 50px; color: #BBB; line-height: 1.8;\">\n      At iColorPacks, we believe in honest, direct-factory pricing. Your final cost is determined by material choice, structure complexity, surface finishes, and order volume.\n    </p>\n    \n    <div class=\"stats-grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 60px;\">\n      <div class=\"stat-item\" style=\"padding: 30px; border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.1); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);\">\n        <h3 style=\"color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 20px;\">01. Materials</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #888;\">Rigid board, Kraft, or Ivory board options.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-item\" style=\"padding: 30px; border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.1); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);\">\n        <h3 style=\"color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 20px;\">02. Finishes</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #888;\">Foil stamping, Embossing, UV or Soft Touch.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-item\" style=\"padding: 30px; border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.1); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);\">\n        <h3 style=\"color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 20px;\">03. Volume</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #888;\">Unit prices drop significantly as quantity increases.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-item\" style=\"padding: 30px; border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.1); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);\">\n        <h3 style=\"color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 20px;\">04. Shipping</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #888;\">DDP Sea, Air, or Express options available.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"background: rgba(201,168,76,0.05); padding: 40px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px dashed var(--gold); display: inline-block; max-width: 600px;\">\n      <p style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #DDD;\">\n        <strong style=\"color: var(--gold);\">Pro Tip:</strong> Ordering 1,000+ units can often reduce your unit cost by 40% compared to small-batch MOQs due to manufacturing setup efficiencies.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- OUR MISSION & BRAND STORY -->\n  <section id=\"our-story\" style=\"padding: 120px 10%; background: #0A0A0A; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n    <div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center;\">\n      <div style=\"position: relative;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%; height: 500px; background: #111; border: 1px solid var(--gold); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;\">\n          <img src=\"https://sc01.alicdn.com/kf/A0d63eec0b347430f96ca65e9208e0780A.png\" data-icp-fallback=\"1\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null;this.src='https://www.icolorpacks.com/images/Acb25be062a874fd7a7fc4b77a51f0790Z.webp'\" alt=\"iColorPacks Manufacturing Facility\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.9;\">\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"position: absolute; bottom: -30px; right: -30px; background: var(--gold); color: #000; padding: 20px 30px; border-radius: 8px; font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n          \"Precision in every fold.\"\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n        <span class=\"section-label\" style=\"margin-left: 0;\">Our Mission</span>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\" style=\"margin-left: 0; margin-bottom: 30px;\">iColorPacks: A Commitment to <em>Excellence.</em></h2>\n        <div style=\"color: #BBB; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 16px;\">\n          <p style=\"margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n            In a global market flooded with generic packaging, <strong style=\"color: var(--gold);\">iColorPacks</strong> was founded in Wenzhou with a singular professional mission: to bridge the gap between mass manufacturing and luxury craftsmanship.\n          </p>\n          <p style=\"margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n            We don't just produce boxes; we engineer brand identities. Our philosophy is rooted in <strong>\"Functional Aesthetics\"</strong>—ensuring that every rigid box and luxury carrier we create is as structurally sound as it is visually captivating.\n          </p>\n          <p style=\"margin-bottom: 35px;\">\n            At <strong style=\"color: var(--gold);\">iColorPacks</strong>, we believe packaging is more than a container; it's a promise. A promise of food-grade safety for bakeries, unyielding protection for fragile perfumes, and a viral unboxing experience for modern D2C brands. We treat your brand’s reputation as our own.\n          </p>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\">\n            <div style=\"width: 60px; height: 1px; background: var(--gold);\"></div>\n            <div style=\"font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 24px; color: var(--gold);\">iColorPacks Team</div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-top: 5px; margin-left: 80px;\">B2B Packaging Solutions Expert</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- FAQ -->\n  <section id=\"faq\" class=\"faq\">\n    <div class=\"faq-container\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Common <em>Questions.</em></h2>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\"><details><summary>What is your Minimum Order Quantity (MOQ)?</summary><div class=\"faq-content\">We offer agile MOQ starting at 100-500 units for custom gift boxes and shopping bags, providing flexibility for brands at all stages.</div></details></div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\"><details><summary>Where is the iColorPacks factory located?</summary><div class=\"faq-content\">Our facility is located in Wenzhou, China, known globally as the hub for premium B2B packaging and printing excellence.</div></details></div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\"><details><summary>Do you provide free packaging design support?</summary><div class=\"faq-content\">Yes, our in-house team assists with structural design, technical file optimization, and provides free 3D mockups within 24 hours.</div></details></div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\"><details><summary>Can you ship directly to Amazon FBA warehouses?</summary><div class=\"faq-content\">Absolutely. We handle all labeling, DDP logistics, and documentation required for direct-to-warehouse delivery globally.</div></details></div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\"><details><summary>What are your typical production lead times?</summary><div class=\"faq-content\">Standard production at our Wenzhou factory takes 12-18 days. Urgent seasonal orders can often be expedited.</div></details></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- FOOTER -->\n  <footer id=\"contact-info\">\n    <div class=\"footer-grid\">\n      <div class=\"footer-col\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"logo\">iColorPacks</a>\n        <p style=\"font-size:14px; color:#BBB; margin-top:20px; line-height:1.8;\"><span style=\"color:var(--gold); font-family:'Playfair Display', serif; font-style:italic; font-size:16px;\">\"Packaging that Colors Your Life.\"</span><br>Premier B2B manufacturing partner for global luxury brands.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"footer-col\">\n        <h4>Connect with Us</h4>\n        <ul class=\"footer-links\">\n          <li><span class=\"footer-icon\">✉</span><a href=\"mailto:icolorpacks@gmail.com\">icolorpacks@gmail.com</a></li>\n          <li><span class=\"footer-icon\">💬</span><a href=\"https://wa.me/86180